    "name": "Fresh forest incumbent with one band-DP and single-leaf lookahead",
    "authors": [
      "NikolaStarx"
    ],
    "method": "For each input, obtain a fresh forest incumbent; then construct at most one input-structure-derived band-DP plus single-leaf-lookahead plan. Evaluate only within the fixed three-E0 ceiling and accept only a strictly lower official Makespan. No case table, prior score or plan selection. Failed, duplicate, pruned, timed-out and unevaluated candidate states remain in the solver receipt.",
